'' Collection initialisers (a tiko extension), refused: a type that needs construction but
'' has no Add, PushBack or Push (TKO0843, where the list used to be dropped in silence); a
'' shared collection whose element names a frame variable (TKO0668 -- it is filled in the
'' module initializer, before main's frame exists); a static member's definition (TKO0844,
'' not yet); and the elements' own errors, which are the ordinary ones for the synthesised
'' calls -- arity and conversion, at the element. A plain-data type with a Push method is
'' not a collection and is untouched.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc tests/diagnostics/src/collinit-errors.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: collinit-errors.bas(11,18): error TKO0843: 'z' cannot take an initializer list: its type has no Add, PushBack or Push method
'' EXPECT-OUT: collinit-errors.bas(22,49): error TKO0844: an initializer list on the static member 'm' is not supported yet; fill it with calls after its definition
'' EXPECT-OUT: collinit-errors.bas(25,37): error TKO0775: this call passes 2 argument(s), but 'push' takes 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: collinit-errors.bas(26,40): error TKO0698: this argument does not convert to the parameter's type
'' EXPECT-OUT: collinit-errors.bas(17,45): error TKO0668: a shared initialiser cannot reference 'framevar', which is not shared
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 5
